---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      Hi there! I'm Keira Lee Rice, a scientist who likes to draw.
    </p>
    <p>
      I've moved around a fair bit: I grew up in Shanghai and Singapore,
      studied in Hong Kong, and now live in the Netherlands. I'm fluent in
      English and Mandarin.
    </p>
    <p>
      My background is in developmental biology, with a PhD from the Hong
      Kong University of Science and Technology. Today I work at a biotech
      startup, on respiratory viruses and the nasal sprays that protect against
      them. Outside of work, I'm the chalkboard artist and illustrator for
      the Ig Nobel Prizes, and I design logos and other materials.
    </p>
    <p>
      I enjoy producing scientific figures and visual explainers for
      scientific audiences, and illustrations that explain science to people
      who aren't scientists.
    </p>
    <p>More art, more humour, more wonder.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 40rem;
    padding-block: var(--space-4) var(--space-16);
  }
</style>
